H2(d, "C.2 Learning from usage")
P(d, "Consider two periods with discount factor 0.9. The vendor invests in reach *A*_{1} in period one and sets a first-period price. Reach in period two is *A*_{2} = min(1.3, *A*_{1} + *λ* × first-period adoption share), where *λ* measures learning intensity. Investment occurs only in period one.")
